    "en": [
      "The image depicts two men dressed in traditional Greek attire, one standing with a rifle and the Greek flag, and the other kneeling. Both wear red caps typical of the Greek Evzones, signifying Greek fighters. In the background, there is a circular cutout featuring a city with domed buildings, likely a mosque, underlining the period of Ottoman rule. The text on the card is in Greek."
